g r a p h i c a l a b s t r a c t
Using surfactant cetyltrimethylammonium bromide (CTAB) as modifier, MOF-derived Ni-N doped porous carbon catalysts were prepared in aqueous solution, and their $C O_{2}\mathrm{RR}$ performance was investigated.
